// wadlist.momo - `wadinfo /l`, the listing alone, as a fixture of its own
// (DESIGN §41).
//
// The program is `wadinfo`'s, from `shared/lib/moinfo.momo`, and only the
// command tail differs: a project has one `.args`, so a mode wants a project.
// The switch sits between the two paths, which the tail has to accept.
//
// `BASE.WAD` and `PATCH.WAD` are copies of `wadinfo`'s, byte for byte - a
// change is made there and copied here. PATCH.WAD is damaged on purpose, and
// nothing here may say so: the listing ends at its last row because the checks
// never ran, and a check that ran would print a finding the summary could not
// hide either.

include "lib/moinfo.momo"

infoRun()
